  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CSSF Economic Stabilisation Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To strengthen the Central Bank of Yemen&apos;s capacity by encouraging greater accountability and transparency around the use of public funds. To support the UK&apos;s membership of the Technical Advisory Committee to enable a more forward-leaning, joined-up and enduring approach to support Yemen&apos;s economy. To facilitate the engagement of Yemen&apos;s private sector with relevant economic and political stakeholders to ensure they have a role in recovery and reconstruction efforts in Yemen.</narrative>
  </description>
